flowchart LR
    Host[Host application] -->|Public API v1| App[audioprep-app]
    App --> Scheduler[audioprep-scheduler\nonly SQLite writer]
    Scheduler --> Store[(SQLite control DB)]
    Scheduler --> Planner[audioprep-planner]
    Scheduler --> Worker[audioprep-worker subprocess]
    Worker --> Tmp[Private tmp]
    Worker -->|result envelope| Scheduler
    Scheduler -->|verified CAS commit| CAS[(Immutable CAS)]
    Scheduler --> Delivery[audioprep-delivery]
    Delivery --> Staging[Deliverable staging]
    Staging -->|fsync + same-FS rename| Published[Published directory]
    App --> Review[audioprep-review]
    Review --> Scheduler
